{"version":1,"content":"<p>微軟正在逐步關閉其長期運行的內部創新項目「The Garage」，這一持續了17年的公司級創新平台即將結束作為獨立項目的歷史。根據曝光的內部文件顯示，微軟計劃取消「The Garage」作為統一運營機構的職能，並調整全球多個相關實體空間的使用方式。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583416.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T17:20:36.804796+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T16:15:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T17:17:54.243018+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T17:17:54.243018+00:00","content_hash":"466ac1dbe8b2901da7e1ff8e5476bf46c2a349986a52a205f6bc29ded24033b1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}